WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.050
A rate each year multiplies, not adds.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.950
The dashed line adds the same dollars every year.

3
00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:12.883
The solid curve earns on what it has already earned.

4
00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:16.659
A higher rate pulls the curve away faster.
